1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:05,000
Your notch has been waiting for something to do.

2
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:10,900
On a Mac, Visor turns it into an island.

3
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:16,400
Your music, your week and your files, right under the camera.

4
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:19,600
And now, on Windows too.

5
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,600
With nothing to show, it's a sliver, clear of your tabs.

6
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:26,900
Play a song and it peeks out to tell you what's on.

7
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:33,000
Rest the pointer on it: your player, your week, your next call.

8
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:40,600
Turn it up from the speaker, or start a timer with a click.

9
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:43,900
Park files on the shelf, then drag them wherever they go.

10
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,500
Then it steps out of your way.

11
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:51,000
Free, open source, and yours to try today.

